  ['MAINT_TEETH 24 both rings · two pawls π apart = 12 pitches, so they act in unison']: 'MAINT_TEETH 両環とも 24 · つめ二つが π = 12 ピッチ差 — つまり同時に働く',
  ['THE LIVE TORQUE PATH']: '生きたトルクの経路',
